{"id":"323b0a74dc337ecf","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-dnc.md","title":"对角不可计算与不动点自由函数","display":"df-dnc — 对角不可计算与不动点自由函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-dnc","aliases":["43-df-dnc"],"display":"df-dnc — 对角不可计算与不动点自由函数","depends_on":["[[43-df-oracle-computation]]","[[43-df-ce]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.19, print p.72 / PDF p.92","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-dnc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-dnc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dnc — 对角不可计算与不动点自由函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4400f4836786a4bd\" href=\"?note=4400f4836786a4bd\" title=\"43-df-oracle-computation\">43-df-oracle-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.19, print p.72 / PDF p.92"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 总定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e=\\Phi_e^\\varnothing\">\\(\\varphi_e=\\Phi_e^\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\">\\(W_e=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DNC}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow=y\\Rightarrow f(e)\\ne y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{DNC}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow=y\\Rightarrow f(e)\\ne y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BinaryDNC}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{DNC}(f)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BinaryDNC}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{DNC}(f)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FPF}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_{f(e)}\\ne W_e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FPF}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_{f(e)}\\ne W_e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>f始终总定义；只要第e个对角计算输出y，就要求f(e)与y不同。发散时不存在输出见证，不必给发散计算安排虚构值。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：§5.19, print p.72 / PDF p.92。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"4400f4836786a4bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e=\\Phi_e^\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"W_e=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DNC}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow=y\\Rightarrow f(e)\\ne y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BinaryDNC}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{DNC}(f)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FPF}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_{f(e)}\\ne W_e).","display":true}],"bytes":1269,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-dnc]] — 对角不可计算与不动点自由函数"},{"id":"1677d7f7248ffdaa","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-dnc]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-jump]]。"},{"id":"8a46f83845d36b9e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{Autocomplex}$、$\\operatorname{DNC}$、函数归约 $\\le_T$ 见 [[43-df-order-complexity]]、[[43-df-dnc]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。"},{"id":"d74cf642b5d1413a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{OrderComplex}$、$\\operatorname{DNC}$、$\\Phi_e^X,u_e^X$、$\\operatorname{Computable}$ 见 [[43-df-order-complexity]]、[[43-df-dnc]]、[[43-df-oracle-computation]]、[[43-df-computable]]。所量化 $f,b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 均总定义。"},{"id":"f17f2aaa45f81579","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{AsSequence}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]；其余符号见 [[43-df-effhausdim]]、[[43-df-dnc]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。"},{"id":"91bfa9b664aabf49","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depen